{"ref":"BDB, יִתְרוֹ","hw":"יִתְרוֹ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְרוֹ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> father of Moses’ wife <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:1\" href=\"/Exodus.3.1\">Ex 3:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:18\" href=\"/Exodus.4.18\">4:18</a> b; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:1\" href=\"/Exodus.18.1\">18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:2\" href=\"/Exodus.18.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:5\" href=\"/Exodus.18.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:6\" href=\"/Exodus.18.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:9\" href=\"/Exodus.18.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:10\" href=\"/Exodus.18.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:12\" href=\"/Exodus.18.12\">12</a> (all E), = <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶתֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:18\" href=\"/Exodus.4.18\">4:18</a>; in all 𝔊 Ιοθορ.","next":"BDB, יִתְרִי","prev":"BDB, יִתְרָה"}